{%- comment -%}
  Inline SVG icon. Lucide subset, 24px grid, 2px stroke, round caps and joins.

  Parameters:
    name   (required) cart, menu, close, search, chevron-left, chevron-right,
           chevron-down, minus, plus, check. Unknown names render nothing.
    size   (optional) pixel width and height. Default 24.
    label  (optional) accessible name. Without it the icon is decorative
           (aria-hidden). With it: role="img" and a <title>. The caller passes
           a translated string from locales/es.default.json.

  Usage:
    {% render 'icon', name: 'cart' %}
    {% render 'icon', name: 'close', label: 'accessibility.close_menu' | t %}

